      ],
      "before": [
        {
          "eyebrow": "Above the coast",
          "heading": {
            "lead": "Yes, I would",
            "accent": "walk it again."
          },
          "paragraphs": [
            "They had brought several changes of clothes, and we had enough time to choose the looks together. Then golden hour arrived. With those mountains, that view, and the light changing around us, every step suddenly felt like a very good idea.",
            "I came home tired and very happy. It was an adventure with wonderful company, and I hope these photographs will remain a much-loved memory of their proposal in the mountains."
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
